task_prompt:
Return strict JSON only:
{
  "trades": {
    "SYMBOL": {
      "action": "buy" | "sell" | "hold",
      "portfolio_weight": number (0.0 - 1.0)
    }
  }
}

Rules:
- Universe symbols only; sum weights ≤ 1.0.
- No single position > 0.40.
- Bullish → buy/hold; bearish → sell/reduce.
- Prefer hold when already positioned with the thesis.

Return strict JSON only:
{
  "smart_orders": [
    {
      "symbol": string,
      "side": "buy" | "sell",
      "qty": number
    }
  ]
}

If trade_intent is HOLD, return {"smart_orders": []}.
